WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:06.150
The overall result of SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé's competitions so far...

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.610
Is 50-50! But some day, I'll put an end to that!

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.430
How about not just "some day"

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:13.900
but at the upcoming Paprika Academy School Festival,

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.440
the Paprika Festival-pri?

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.120
Paprika Festival?

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.500
We'll have a contest event-pri.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.910
Put screens all over the grounds and broadcast it live.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.830
And the audience there will decide who wins.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:26.960
That's what I like to hear.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.170
But I can't imagine Headmistress Ookanda approving that.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:36.390
The grounds are for the middle school's events. She's in charge of the elementary school.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:38.600
Received and understood.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.060
And as such...

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.160
we'll broadcast our shows at the Paprika Festival,

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:48.020
and have a contest between SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:49.860
That's right-pri!

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:53.530
Let's go all out. Let it <i>GO!</i>

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:56.640
Let's Pop Step Get that victory!

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:57.950
Capisce!

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.910
[catchphrases intensifying]

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:40.930
Hello. It's everyone's beloved elder brother, Akai Meganii.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.220
I am here to present you a new song.

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.140
Ta-dah.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:58.160
The new song is now registered in your PriPasses. The title: "Happy Hop Lucky"

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.740
And I took the liberty of booking your upcoming event.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:04.950
I know you'll make my heart skip a beat.

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:06.790
Thank you so much!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:07.950
Well, then:

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:11.690
A new song from me, to you:

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:12.500
Ta-da-da-dah.

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:18.210
Don't be shy now.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.630
New song registered! Hot off the press!

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:26.780
We'll win for sure with this! More like SoLaMi <i>Frown</i>!

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:28.070
Right, Leona?

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:29.980
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:33.600
The title: "Change My World"

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:37.400
I'm looking forward to having my heart melted.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:38.900
We'll do our best!

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.370
Thank you.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:43.820
We'll definitely...

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:44.870
Win!

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:45.850
Yeah!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:48.170
Go!

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.790
I have registered a number of new coords in honor of your new song.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.810
Go on through the gate to try them on.

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:58.210
Thanks lots.

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:00.670
I can't wait to see them.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:06.800
The Giraffe Dress.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:09.810
So cute! Roar!

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:12.760
I don't think giraffes sound like that-kuma.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.460
Fluffy Penguin Dress.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.000
This poncho is like wings.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:17.440
Roar! Roar!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.320
Roar, roar... Are you even listening?
Roar! Roar!

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.580
The Rainbow Diamond Dress.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:25.230
My <i>heart</i> feels fancy!

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.730
The Forest Girl Dress.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:31.450
Fantastic. The wind is calling for me.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.540
The Dream Attendant Dress.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.650
I feel like I can fly!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.720
Star Dress.

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.960
I'll be the brightest star in the idol sky!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.480
You're shining-kuma!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.060
The Animal Dress.

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.520
Careful, I bite! Roar!

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.000
Wild-kuma!

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:49.320
The Sparkling Ramune Dress.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.680
Ramune? How refreshing.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.100
Cool-kuma!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:58.270
None of these could lose to Dressing Pafé-kuma!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:03.560
Come on then! Let's try them all on and decide on which ones to use today!

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:05.240
Cacacapisce!

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:11.080
So you're doing a show at the Paprika Festival?

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:13.580
Oh, you've already heard?

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.770
I know everything about PriPara.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:21.230
I really would have preferred a Pink Actress show, though.

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:24.110
But I guess your show will have to do.

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:25.120
Good luck.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.510
Capisce!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.770
A PriPara concert!

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:36.620
A contest between SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.810
And exclusively for our school!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:39.860
VIP treatment!

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.900
Seriously? Nice!

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:44.680
See how excited everyone is, Lala?

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:45.930
I can't wait either!

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.150
Thanks, Nao!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:51.760
We'll make it the best concert ever, for the best festival ever!

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.120
Yeah! I'll be cheering for you!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.520
Ding dong dong ding!

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:00.310
To everyone on the Disciplinary Committee and the Paprika Festival organizers:

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:02.600
Come to my office at once.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:05.460
Ding dong dong dong.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:13.100
Now, about this PriPara concert at the Paprika Festival...

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:16.400
I absolutely cannot allow this!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.310
I would like to point out, Headmistress,

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:22.900
that the school grounds are reserved for the middle school branch's events.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:23.810
And as such...

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:32.190
Having the approval of the middle school branch's Principal, it won't need <i>my</i>, Ookanda Gloria's, approval.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.880
That's what you're saying, correct?

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:34.490
Correct.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:37.980
<i>She stands firm even against headmistress Ookanda!</i>

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.050
<i>That's our committee head!</i>

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:45.910
Seems you're unaware of our rule 87.

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:50.390
87? "Students may not under any circumstances draw graffiti on the statue of the founder."

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.680
That's not the one.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:56.180
Impossible, I have memorized the entire rulebook word for word.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.140
I'm certain that was correct.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.990
Oh, pardon me.

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:04.820
There are a number of rules you're unaware of.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.030
That is?

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.550
A rulebook.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:10.490
There's an additional rulebook?

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.300
There is indeed!

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:15.120
And these rules are known as:

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:17.950
The Principal's Rules!

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.840
The Principal's Rules?

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:29.900
Full of rules only I, the headmistress, know!

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:32.050
And article 87:

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:32.070
Paprika Festival events must obtain approval from both principal teachers regardless of location.

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:38.770
Article 87

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:40.970
How can that...

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:44.480
Only you know? That's not playing fair!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:48.190
As such, I veto the PriPara concert idea.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:51.730
B-But the announcement has been made!

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:52.620
And the posters are...

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:55.360
You seem very invested in this, Minami.

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:58.870
Could it be that <i>you</i> have been going to PriPara?

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:02.200
That is irrelevant.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:05.470
I am simply looking to make the Paprika Festival as successful as possible!

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:07.590
The students as well as their friends from elsewhere are looking forward to...

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:10.690
Neither PriPara nor friends are things our students need!

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:14.010
When I say "denied!" I <i>mean</i> denied.

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:22.240
Canceled? No way!

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.440
Eh?

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.650
What a shame.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.120
After all the talk of having it under control...

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:34.610
You really <i>are</i> all talk.

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:37.030
Grasping at straws.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:41.500
I'm out of ideas as well. So that's the end of that.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:46.420
M-Minami...

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:04.940
I was really looking forward to the concert.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.150
Leona?

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.930
Not even because I wanted us to win.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:15.780
For all the elementary schoolers and boys who can't come to PriPara themselves...

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:19.370
I was hoping we could show them what it's like.

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.830
Well, yeah...

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:36.780
There it is!

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.250
Mi-Mireille!

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:51.150
Who's there?

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:58.030
I'm, uh... Mega-little-brother!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.620
Mega-little-brother?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:06.580
I want to see your concert! I mean the SoLaMi SMILE concert at Paprika Festival!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.960
You know I'm an idol?

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.290
Please don't give up.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:11.870
Head Disciplinarian...

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.640
No, Mireille!

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:19.210
I know you can find a way to make it happen in spite of the Principal's new rulebook!

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:21.760
Show us your brilliance!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:28.250
Of course I will! I can do it.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:32.490
I haven't given up. I've just been running calculations on how to turn it around.

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:35.990
<i>Yes. Calculating.</i>

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:46.160
And I have the perfect answer.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:50.440
Mega-little-brother, go tell the rest of the committee

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.030
that we're helping make the concert happen.

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:54.020
Yes ma'am!

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:56.840
<i>Thank you, Amamiya.</i>

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.800
<i>Good luck, Mireille!</i>

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:01.800
Head Disciplinarian?

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:06.360
I have a way to get back at Ookanda fair and square!

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.220
Great.

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.260
Capisce!

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:12.730
Miss Meganee, we have a favor to ask!

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:14.690
You too?

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:16.650
Seems like...

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:19.360
We've reached the same conclusion.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:24.170
Your request is regarding the Paprika Festival PriPara broadcast, yes?

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:25.080
Yes!

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.110
What a marvelous Paprika Festival.

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:44.260
I feel great after crushing that PriPara concert.

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:52.140
To everyone enjoying the Paprika Festival:

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:55.020
We are starting a special event soon!

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:57.230
Special event?

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:00.440
Come see the PriPara concert near the front gates!

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:03.110
Let's get hyped up!

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:06.200
PriPara concert?

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:08.570
It's not canceled?

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:09.380
Let's go!

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:10.260
Let's go too!

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:11.260
Yeah!

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:13.120
H-Hold it right there!

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:16.510
No one will make it past this line!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.560
Right this way!

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:23.050
The show's over here!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.220
You there! No pushing-chanko!

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:29.140
You kids! Return at once!

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:34.100
PriPara concert! I authorized no such thing!

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:39.280
Th-They have a permit!

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.490
Permit?

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:47.390
Th-The event is outside school grounds. Outside the bounds of the Principal's rules.

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:50.860
Just whose permit does this have then?

00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:51.950
The police!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.640
Police?

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:56.170
The event has all the proper permits in accordance with traffic law.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.840
Lawyer
Prosecutor

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.130
And here's the relevant paperwork!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:05.090
I've been thoroughly blindsided!

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.550
The crowd is all ready!

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:09.470
Just as planned-pri!

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.880
Where's it being shown?

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:12.980
Nothing here.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.330
The PriPara trailer has arrived-chanko!

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.100
The plan went off without a hitch!

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.570
It's only just begun!

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:29.490
PriPara Trailer! Transform!

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:51.470
We're all ready-chanko!

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:55.060
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:57.560
You may also scan friend tickets.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.600
Coord Change Start!

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:08.820
Dressing Pafé is using Fortune Party's number one seller, the Marching Star Coord.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.890
Marching Star Coord!

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:17.410
Ladies and gentlemen of Paprika Academy, let's go wild!

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:22.170
Hi! Welcome to our PriPara concert!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.040
Enjoy yourselves!

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:27.800
Dressing Pafé proudly presents:

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.090
Our new song: CHANGE! MY WORLD!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.410
Shion!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:50.840
Making Drama Switch On!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.820
Girls and boys!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:02.920
All the students at our school!

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.980
They're having fun!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.800
That's wonderful!

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.330
Full-speed Dash!

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:12.150
Fly! Balloons!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:18.250
Cyalume Change!

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:24.460
<i>Go!</i>

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.380
Yay!

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:09.430
SoLaMi SMILE's new coords are based on festival snacks.

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.420
Cotton Candy Fluff Coord!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:17.430
Popcorn Pompom Coord! Pri!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.750
Chocolate Cream Blend Coord!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:24.820
The show ain't over yet!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:27.230
SoLaMi SMILE is here-pri!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.900
With our new song, Happy Hop Lucky!

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:51.100
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.150
Twirly twirl!

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:57.240
Sparkly sparkle!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.870
Deliver them to everyone!

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.770
Our feelings!

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:09.210
And this complimentary Red Flash pizza!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:14.390
Exciting... Present For You!

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:18.260
Cyalume Change!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.250
Lala!

00:19:58.250 --> 00:19:59.670
Sophie!

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:05.100
PriPara...

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:08.280
M-My heart...

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:15.480
S-Stop this at once!

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.960
Return to school grounds at once!

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.650
Return at once!

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:22.480
Lady Sophie!

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:23.360
Chanko!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:27.870
PriPara?! Friends?!

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:39.380
<i>One day...</i>

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:43.240
<i>Even the headmistress will understand.</i>

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:47.990
So it was another tie, but...

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:50.170
I'm glad they enjoyed us both.

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:52.060
Yeah, it was fun.

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:57.810
But we'll settle this yet.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.400
Now your talking my language-pri!

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:06.620
I see how it is...

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:10.160
I have been too soft.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:12.830
Time to take decisive action!

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:18.080
Until all trace of PriPara is gone from the world!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:22.050
I'll definitely crush it this time!

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:26.660
Definitely! Definitely! Definitely! Definitely!

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.010
Definitely! Definitely!

00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:33.160
Remember PriPara!

00:23:06.040 --> 00:23:08.030
Remember PriPara.

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:10.320
I've made my decision.

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:14.330
I will erase the word PriPara from my school!

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:17.910
What? Ookanda is becoming the middle school's principal too?

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:19.920
To all students:

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:23.790
From now on, going to PriPara is forbidden for all students!

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:27.390
Oh no! No one will be able to go to PriPara!

00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:32.650
Next time: The Last Day of PriPara!

00:23:32.650 --> 00:23:35.610
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
